 type=\"image/jpeg\" width=\"\" /><img alt=\"Grain Drying - Corn\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/i/1778713326000/x970/images/grain_shoot.jpg\" title=\"grain_shoot\" /></picture></div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Corn Discount Schedule</h2>\n\n<h3>Test weight shrink factor:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">54.0 &amp; up &ndash; No discount<br />\n52.0 to 53.9 &ndash; 1.0%<br />\n50.0 to 51.9 &ndash; 1.4%<br />\n47.0 to 49.9 &ndash; 1.8%</div>\n\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">45.0 to 46.9 &ndash; 2.5%<br />\n43.0 to 44.9 &ndash; 3.6%<br />\n41.0 to 42.9 &ndash; 4.8%<br />\n39.0 to 40.9 &ndash; 6.0%</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>Foreign Material:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">Under 3.0% - No discount<br />\n3.1 to 4.0% - $.02 per percent<br />\n4.1 to 5.0% - $.03 per percent</div>\n\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">5.1 to 6.0% - $.04 per percent<br />\n6.1 to 10.0% - $.05 per percent<br />\n10.0% &amp; Above &ndash; Subject to rejection</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>Damage:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">Under 5% - No discount<br />\n5.1 to 7.0% - $.01 per percent</div>\n\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">7.1 to 20.0% - $.02 per percent<br />\n20.1% &amp; Above - $.03 per percent</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>Heat Damage:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-12 columns\">Under .2% - No discount<br />\n.3 to 2.0% - $.02 per percent<br />\n2.1% &amp; Over &ndash; Subject to rejection</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Sour - $.10/bu &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Musty - $.10/bu &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Infested - $.20/bu</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2>Soybean Discount Schedule:</h2>\n\n<h3>Soybeans dry at 13.0% moisture.</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-12 columns\">13.0 % and under &ndash; 1% handling shrink and $.075/bu in charge<br />\n13.1% and over &ndash; Shrink to 13%, 1% handling shrink and $.075/bu in charge.</div>\n\n<div class=\"medium-12 columns\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div class=\"medium-12 columns\">No in charge or additional 1% shrink on grain sold to Sparta Co-op upon delivery.</div>\n\n<div class=\"medium-12 columns\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n\n<h3>Test weight shrink factor:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-12 columns\">54.0 &amp; up &ndash; No discount<br />\n52.0 to 53.9 &ndash; $.01 per pound<br />\n50.0 to 51.9 &ndash; $.02 per pound<br />\n48.0 to 49.9 &ndash; $.04 per pound</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>Foreign Material:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-12 columns\">Any foreign material over 1% will be deducted from total weight.<br />\nAny load testing over 5% foreign material is subject to rejection.</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>Damage:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">Under 2% - No discount<br />\n2.1 to 4.0% - $.015 per &frac12; percent</div>\n\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">4.1 to 8.0% - $.03 per &frac12; percent<br />\n8.1% &amp; Above &ndash; Subject to rejection</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>Splits:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">Under 20% - No discount<br />\n20.1 to 30.0% - $.01 each 5%</div>\n\n<div class=\"medium-6 columns\">30.1 to 40.0% - $.02 each 5%<br />\nOver 40.0% - Subject to rejection</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>Heat Damage:</h3>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"medium-12 columns\">Under .2% - No discount<br />\n.3 to 1.0% - $.02 per each .1 percent<br />\n1.1 to 1.5% &ndash; $.03 per each .1 percent<br />\n1.6% &amp; Over &ndash; Subject to rejection</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Sour - $.10/bu &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Musty - $.10/bu &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Infested - $.15/bu</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Any questions regarding the Grain Policy contact Phil at <a href=\"tel:608-269-2255\">608-269-2255</a></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- footer here -->\n<footer>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\n 